        "text": "Generative AI can perform more human‑like tasks compared to traditional AI.",
        "refs": ["Q0014"],
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Then if you think about human‑like capacities, traditional AI has limited capabilities, whereas generative AI has high capabilities.",
